{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Mmfxi5P9IJ3Z4omLdATCRQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:45.619660+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Mmfxi5P9IJ3Z4omLdATCRQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>夏令营活动报名</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>为增进学生对国科大杭州高等研究院（以下简称：杭高院）药物科学与技术学院（以下简称：药学院）的了解，进一步激发青年学子对药学领域的热情，培养大学生科研探索精神，选拔有科研潜质的优秀大学生继续深造，我院预计2026年7月-8月举办“杭高院药学院2026年优秀大学生暑期夏令营”活动，具体时间另行通知。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/WxEFeCzRPJoXn9fEpkep7nQqv8wiarhmyXb6dUKqiaU3n7GjHgmDXLGW0WibaRibrnacozPYnAm3JRfylG5icjXrsUiaK6ibCia4deaBOXRoOgL4ibdg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><b><span>学院简</span></b></span><b><span>介</span></b></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>药学院是国科大杭州高等研究院于2019年最先启动建设二级学院之一，由中国科学院上海药物研究所承办。药学院秉承国科大“科教融合、协同育人、创新实践、服务社会”的教育理念，瞄准药学科学前沿和生命健康领域的重大新药创制问题，融合浙江省和杭州市的资源条件和政策支持，以培养“国际化、创新型、复合型、实用型”的药学学术型和工程应用型人才为目标，以产业转化为导向，为国家和区域的新药创制和生物医药发展贡献力量。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/WxEFeCzRPJo0ZREHEbtp2dTLicSrruicknGKjUNkNefo3eybOOnT8a06BadjzibKW8me5xdNKzRSF9xjHTRdYDM4gIQ9PqelC4p42wKQZ9ufgI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>研究生培养</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>杭高院药学院是国科大和上海药物研究所最重要的药物人才培养基地之一，拥有药学人才培养的强劲实力。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>Part.01</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>师资力量雄厚</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>依托</span><span>中国科学院</span><span>优质人才资源，药学院在引育并举的理念指导下构建了具有自身特色的师资队伍建设体系，集聚了中国药学领域内多个优秀科研团队，建设了一支结构合理、规模适当、素质良好、富有活力、勇于创新、适应学院发展需要的高水平师资队伍。学院目前拥有在岗教职工79人，博后22人，拥有在岗指导研究生学业的导师36人，其中，博士生导师19人，“杰青”基金获得者10人。众多优秀导师为药学院学子的成长保驾护航。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>Part.02</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>课程形式精品多元化</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>学院针对药学前沿及多学科交叉前沿领域开设公共课、专业核心课、专业普及课、专业研讨课、科学前沿讲座5大类课程，使学生既能掌握新药研发所需的专业知识和跨学科知识，又能紧跟学科前沿，接触到科研最新动态。院士进课堂，教授上讲台。HIAS讲堂，邀请各领域顶尖专家加入讲授团队，双创课程，对接业内知名企业，打通从校园到企业的关键环节，助力学生培养。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>Part.03</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>科研平台独具特色</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>学院牵头建设糖类药物省重点实验室聚焦糖类药物研发新理论、新方法与新策略，开展糖类原创药物研发，以期构筑糖类药物前沿阵地；学院与浙大金华院联合共建的省智能新药创制重点实验室致力于构建全流程智能药物设计平台。学院现有化学生物学、药物化学、代谢与免疫药理学、糖类与感染性疾病4个研究中心，下设11个首席教授工作室，完备的科研梯队为保障科研工作的顺利开展提供坚实基础。同时，学院建设有高质量并独具特色的创新药物研发体系，包括人工智能药物设计与评价、高效化合物合成、原创靶标及机制发现与验证、多元化药物活性评价及成药性平台四大技术平台。此外，学院与百诚医药科技股份有限公司、浙江省人民医院共建实践基地，探索科研产业交叉融合模式，构建产学研医一体化协同体系，整合学术、企业技术与临床资源，打造全链条创新平台，培养复合型医药人才，推动科研成果转化及区域大健康产业发展。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>Part.04</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>奖助体系完善</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>杭高院药学院拥有完善的研究生奖助学金体系，涵盖国家助学金、国家奖学金、中国科学院奖学金、国科大学业奖学金、杭高院奖学金、百诚医药企业奖学金、助研、助教、助管等岗位津贴。</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/WxEFeCzRPJoXmwqEQqe9B349h8icPgicWoJQ2K352N9favXicibgXUKOsNFTHg36HhooFaSe6BtUhibUlcoHq24C6eh5xslvOiaAznXlibwpr402Ho/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>夏令营活动介绍</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>2026年药学院夏令营活动将在国科大杭州高等研究院云艺园区（浙江省杭州市西湖区象山支弄1号）实地举办。夏令营期间将安排导师专题讲座、专家交流互动、优秀营员选拔、园区参观等活动。</span></p><p><span>（一）申请条件</span></p><p><span>1．招募对象：化学、生物学、医学、药学、中药学、计算机等相关专业的2027届本科毕业生，综合性大学的化学和生物学学生将优先招募。</span></p><p><span>2．成绩要求：本科期间总评成绩排名在本年级（专业）前20%之内，双一流重点高校学生学习成绩标准可适当放宽；英语达到国家四级合格水平。</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>（二）报名程序</span></p><p><span>1.即日起登陆杭高院药学院报名系统（http://122.224.251.231/enroll_student/login），注册登陆后进入系统首页，选择点击【2026年杭高院药学院全国优秀大学生夏令营】报名申请按钮，按要求填写相关信息，仔细核对无误后，点击保存并提交报名申请。报名截止日期为6月21日。</span></p><p><span>2. 报名系统需提交的附件材料（PDF扫描件）：</span></p><p><span>（1）身份证（含正反面）；</span></p><p><span>（2）英语等级证书；</span></p><p><span>（3）成绩单（需要盖公章）；</span></p><p><span>（4）辅导员推荐信（没有辅导员的学校，可由做学生工作的老师来写推荐信）；</span></p><p><span>（5）其它附件，包括各类“奖励证明”、“等级证书”、“已发表论文首页”等。</span></p><p><span>（三）注意事项</span></p><p><span>（1）确定参营名单后将通过邮件或电话通知营员，未入围的同学不再另行通知；</span></p><p><span>（2）杭高院将为夏令营营员提供来程路费（凭高校或家庭所在城市至杭州的火车硬座或高铁动车二等座车票报销交通补贴）及夏令营期间的食宿，住宿由我院统一安排。提前到达或延迟离开期间的食宿费用自行承担；</span></p><p><span>（3）夏令营活动期间学生安全由本人负责。营员需遵守杭高院药学院相关规定，按照统一安排参加相关活动。</span></p><p><span>（四）联系方式：</span></p><p><span>报名系统技术支持：</span></p><p><span>孙老师 18202417565</span></p><p><span>联系人：</span></p><p><span>甘老师 0571-86080819 </span></p><p><span>邮箱：</span></p><p><span>ganqingqing@ucas.ac.cn</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/WxEFeCzRPJrzf4To5P3CvyECTYBmML3frCzezUhguoCXbUnkb9oBLCicsMMNSINE26XYzJHLPLnibtJUiawkuQON9wqaQqT6ibvp6FB8FzTZyhA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>咨询及信息获取方式</span></strong><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section